flowchart TD
  files[(routes.csv, offers.csv, drivers.csv)] --> poll[Poll size and mtime on a timer]
  poll --> changed{Changed?}
  changed -->|no| poll
  changed -->|yes| load[Parse by header name, validate, check integrity]
  load --> valid{Valid?}
  valid -->|no| keep[Log error, keep last good snapshot]
  keep --> poll
  valid -->|yes| hash{Content hash differs?}
  hash -->|no| poll
  hash -->|yes| swap[Atomic swap, publish on snapshots stream]
  swap --> enqueue[Registry keeps only the latest pending snapshot]
  enqueue --> train[Train off the request path]
  train --> ref[Reference price per market]
  train --> acc[Acceptance model: block-coordinate Newton]
  train --> cs[Cold start from rating and volume]
  train --> prof[Operational profile inferred from history]
  ref --> done{Training succeeded?}
  acc --> done
  cs --> done
  prof --> done
  done -->|yes| replace[Replace models in one step, new modelVersion]
  done -->|no| old[Keep previous models, expose lastReloadError]
